{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#card-zh","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-confirm-gate 是一个面向 DeepSeek Harness 的单轮操作计数插件，通过工具执行前、执行后和 agent 步骤钩子统计持久化操作，并按阈值注入提醒、停止指令或请求确认。它区分读操作与写入、命令、派发等操作；用户消息包含配置的确认词后可放行本轮。插件还会在微信会话中拦截中途交互选项，并提示改用纯文本。适合希望控制 agent 单轮操作预算的 DSH 用户；默认阈值为 10 和 15，可在挂载配置中调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:659","lib/index.js:739","lib/index.js:807","cordis.patch.yml:7-12"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#card-en","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-confirm-gate counts persistent operations in each DeepSeek Harness turn. It adds reminders, then a stop instruction, and requests confirmation at configured limits. Read-only tools are excluded; a confirmation word releases the turn. It also denies mid-turn questions in WeChat sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:659","lib/index.js:739","lib/index.js:807","cordis.patch.yml:7-12"]}
