{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#feature-turn-count","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-confirm-gate 的功能「单轮持久化操作计数」：在工具执行前判断操作是否持久化并按 agent 累计；读、搜索、列表等非持久化工具不会计数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:198","lib/index.js:271","lib/index.js:659"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#feature-tier-notices","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-confirm-gate 的功能「分档提醒与确认」：达到 freeLimit 后在执行结果上下文加入提醒，超过该阈值后改为停止指令，达到 hardLimit 时返回 ask 请求确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:659","lib/index.js:739"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#feature-confirm-release","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-confirm-gate 的功能「确认后放行本轮」：agent 收到包含 confirmWord 的用户消息时设置本轮确认状态，清除计数，并让后续持久化操作不再计数或提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:807","lib/index.js:818"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#feature-wechat-prompt","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-confirm-gate 的功能「微信中途交互拦截」：检测微信会话中的 ask-user-question 调用，在工具执行前拒绝该选项请求，并向模型提供改用纯文本提问的说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:592","lib/index.js:612","lib/index.js:659"]}
