{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-confirm-gate#caveat-readme-mismatch","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-confirm-gate","commit":"bbcb287730b228b63e0c005f127f01da0727da91","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-confirm-gate 使用前须知：README 描述沙盒模式会让计数器停用，但当前源码的 SANDBOX_MANAGED_MODES 是空集合，因此计数逻辑不会因这些模式而跳过。使用以当前实现为准。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:395-398","README.md:15-21"]}
